h-92c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-56c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h92v-92c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h56c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v92h92c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v56z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2091\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix active-default\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"what-exactly-is-a-blockchain\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A blockchain is a decentralized digital ledger that records transactions across multiple computers to ensure transparency and security. As a leading blockchain development company, we utilize this technology to build systems that are tamper-proof and efficient, ideal for industries requiring immutable data handling.<\/span><\/p><\/div>\n                <\/div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n                <div id=\"how-do-apps-run-on-blockchain\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2092\"><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How do apps run on blockchain?<\/span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8zm144 276c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-92v92c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12h-56c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-92h-92c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12v-56c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h92v-92c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h56c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v92h92c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v56z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2092\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"how-do-apps-run-on-blockchain\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Apps on the blockchain, known as decentralized applications (dApps), operate through smart contracts that execute automatically when conditions are met. Our blockchain app development services focus on building scalable dApps that run on networks like Ethereum, enabling trustless operations and real-time automation.<\/span><\/p><\/div>\n               